          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 132531,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la differenza tra <code>get</code> e <code>all</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>get</code> recupera una singola riga, mentre <code>all</code> recupera tutte le righe da una query</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sia <code>get</code> che <code>all</code> recuperano tutte le righe di una query</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>get</code> recupera tutte le righe, mentre <code>all</code> recupera solo la prima riga</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>get</code> recupera una singola riga, mentre <code>all</code> recupera tutte le righe da una query.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La query corrisponde a tre righe. Sostituisci <code>query.get()</code> con <code>query.all()</code>. Come cambia il risultato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Passa da un oggetto riga a un array contenente tutte e tre le righe.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Passa da un array di tre righe a un oggetto riga.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rimane un oggetto riga perché la query non cambia.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Passa da un oggetto riga a un array contenente tutte e tre le righe.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 120306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come includiamo i moduli nel nostro codice?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Utilizzando <code>require</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Utilizzando <code>import</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Utilizzando <code>module</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Utilizzando <code>require</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rimuovi <code>const Database = require(\"better-sqlite3\")</code> ma mantieni <code>new Database(\"data.db\")</code>.</p><p>Supponi che <code>Database</code> non sia definito altrove. Perché la riga rimasta non può più funzionare?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Database non fa più riferimento al modulo importato.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovere require elimina il file data.db.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il nome del file ora deve essere better-sqlite3.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Database non fa più riferimento al modulo importato.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132526,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un nuovo database chiamato database nella directory corrente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;better-sqlite3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" db = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database(\" /><text value=\"&quot;./database.db&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"database\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.</code>, seguito da <code>/</code> e infine <code>database.db</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Carica il driver SQLite e apri <code>database.db</code> dalla directory corrente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;better-sqlite3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" db = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database(\" /><text value=\"&quot;./database.db&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sqlite3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Database.open\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;../database.db&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>require</code>, seguito da <code>\"better-sqlite3\"</code>, <code>new Database</code> e infine <code>\"./database.db\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 132532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>db.exec</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Esegue una query SQL senza restituire risultati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Recupera una singola riga dal database</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Recupera tutte le righe da una tabella</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Esegue una query SQL senza restituire risultati.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un passaggio di configurazione esegue <code>CREATE TABLE</code> una volta, senza riutilizzare parametri né restituire righe. Quale approccio è adatto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eseguire direttamente l'SQL con <code>db.exec</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prepararlo con <code>db.prepare</code>, poi chiamare <code>get</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eseguirlo con <code>db.all</code> per ricevere ogni riga creata</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eseguire direttamente l'SQL con <code>db.exec</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 132506,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>get</code> e passa <code>1</code> per interrogare dinamicamente l'utente con id <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getUserById = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = getUserById.get(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"99\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ id: 1, name: &quot;John Smith&quot; }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>get(1)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 132713,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa questa query parametrizzata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/movies/search&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"request, response\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" query = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM movies WHERE title = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies = query.all(request.query.title);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  response.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json(movies);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"120\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>?</code>.</p></body></html>"
