          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 135959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa un'istruzione di transazione per eseguire più transazioni, ottenere i dettagli dei nuovi amici e inserirli con l'età.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;better-sqlite3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" db = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database(\" /><text value=\"&quot;database.db&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"db.exec(\" /><text value=\"`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS friends (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name TEXT,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  age INTEGER\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" insertFriendWithAge = db.prepare(\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;INSERT INTO friends (name, age) VALUES (?, ?)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" newFriendsWithAges = [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Janice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gunther&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"38\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" insertTransactionWithAge = db.transaction(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"friends\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    insertFriendWithAge.run(friend.name, friend.age);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  insertTransactionWithAge(newFriendsWithAges);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"catch\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (error) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".error(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Transaction failed:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", error.message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rows = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(rows);\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"461\" endIndex=\"472\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 1, name: 'Janice', age: 35 },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 2, name: 'Gunther', age: 38 },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 3, name: 'Mike', age: 40 }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>transaction</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 135960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale delle seguenti affermazioni sulle transazioni è vera?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Raggruppano più query per assicurarsi che abbiano tutte successo o falliscano tutte insieme</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Eseguono solo la prima e l'ultima query</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non possono includere operazioni di inserimento</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Garantiscono che tutte le query abbiano sempre successo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Raggruppano più query per assicurarsi che abbiano tutte successo o falliscano tutte insieme.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una transazione inserisce quattro musicisti, ma il terzo inserimento non riesce. Cosa dovrebbe contenere il database da quella transazione?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nessuno dei suoi inserimenti, perché viene eseguito il rollback della transazione.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Soltanto i primi due inserimenti.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Viene saltato soltanto l'inserimento non riuscito.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Tutti e quattro gli inserimenti, perché le transazioni garantiscono il successo.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nessuno dei suoi inserimenti, perché viene eseguito il rollback della transazione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice in modo da aggiungere <code>\"Tom\"</code> come primo valore alla tabella pets.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;better-sqlite3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" db = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database(\" /><text value=\"&quot;./database.db&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"db.exec(\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" CREATE TABLE pets (name TEXT, species TEXT)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"db.exec(\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" INSERT INTO pets (name, species)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" VALUES (&quot;Tom&quot;, &quot;Cat&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"154\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>db.exec</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132529,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prepara un'istruzione <code>SELECT</code> dinamica.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getUserByIdQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM pets WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = getUserByIdQuery.get(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ id: 50, name: &quot;Bugs&quot;, species: &quot;Bunny&quot; }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>?</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132528,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prepara una query ed eseguila per ottenere tutte le voci dalla tabella colors.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getColorsQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM colors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users = getColorsQuery.all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(users);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 1, color: &quot;red&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 2, color: &quot;green&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 3, color: &quot;blue&quot; }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getColorsQuery</code>, seguito da <code>db</code> e poi <code>.</code>, <code>prepare</code>, <code>getColorsQuery</code>, <code>.all()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza una query preparata in <code>getColorsQuery</code>, poi eseguila affinché <code>users</code> contenga ogni riga di <code>colors</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getColorsQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM colors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users = getColorsQuery.all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(users);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"exec\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"colors\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 1, color: &quot;red&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 2, color: &quot;green&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 3, color: &quot;blue&quot; }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getColorsQuery</code>, seguito da <code>db</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>prepare</code>, <code>getColorsQuery</code> e infine <code>.all()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 132533,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore conterrà <code>pet</code> se nella tabella pets non è presente alcuna voce con l'id <code>999</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getUserByIdQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM pets WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = getUserByIdQuery.get(\" /><text value=\"999\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pet);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>null</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{ }</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>undefined</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La query cerca l'animale con id <code>999</code>, ma nessuna riga corrisponde. Quale risultato distingue correttamente <code>get()</code> da <code>all()</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getUserByIdQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM pets WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = getUserByIdQuery.get(\" /><text value=\"999\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pet);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>get()</code> restituisce <code>undefined</code>; <code>all()</code> restituirebbe un array vuoto</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Entrambi i metodi restituiscono <code>null</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>get()</code> restituisce un oggetto vuoto; <code>all()</code> restituisce <code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Entrambi i metodi generano un errore perché manca l'id <code>999</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>get()</code> restituisce <code>undefined</code>; <code>all()</code> restituirebbe un array vuoto.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 135961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
